WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.356 --> 00:00:20.957
Suddenly there was a loud rumble from deep in the clouds.

2
00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:24.558
Large raindrops fell from the sky.

3
00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:30.199
Waves swelled up from the sea like towering, black mountains.

4
00:00:30.219 --> 00:00:32.740
"Oh, what fun!"

5
00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:34.393
thought the Little Mermaid.

6
00:00:34.413 --> 00:00:36.454
"A storm is coming!"

7
00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:41.937
In the Sea Kingdom, she and her sisters were safe from storms.

8
00:00:43.237 --> 00:00:45.879
They loved to play in the churning water.

9
00:00:47.139 --> 00:00:48.640
But the sailors were frightened.

10
00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:52.502
They yanked the ropes that controlled the sails.

11
00:00:53.823 --> 00:00:57.665
The Prince's ship turned to and fro in every direction.

12
00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:02.788
Strong winds rocked the ship from side to side.

13
00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:07.265
The angry sea would not let them sail back to land.

14
00:01:07.285 --> 00:01:09.766
"All hands on deck!"

15
00:01:10.427 --> 00:01:11.567
shouted one sailor.

16
00:01:11.587 --> 00:01:14.388
"The ship is out of control!"

17
00:01:14.989 --> 00:01:15.809
shouted another.

18
00:01:17.089 --> 00:01:20.171
Unafraid, the Little Mermaid waited in the distance.

19
00:01:21.731 --> 00:01:26.193
Through the darkness she watched the ship and thought, "Lucky me!

20
00:01:26.813 --> 00:01:28.674
Now the Prince can't sail away!

21
00:01:29.975 --> 00:01:32.776
Maybe I can get another look at him before morning."

22
00:01:34.144 --> 00:01:37.465
The Little Mermaid didn't understand that the ship was in danger.

23
00:01:38.926 --> 00:01:43.488
The storm grew stronger, and huge waves crashed on the deck.

24
00:01:44.788 --> 00:01:48.050
The wind beat against the sails and tore them to pieces.

25
00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:53.652
Then, without warning, the main mast snapped and fell into the water.

26
00:01:54.772 --> 00:01:58.894
The boat began to tip to one side, and seawater flooded the deck.

27
00:01:58.914 --> 00:02:01.895
"Get out the lifeboats!"

28
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:03.276
cried a sailor.

29
00:02:04.352 --> 00:02:05.852
"We must save the passengers!"

30
00:02:06.533 --> 00:02:08.333
But it was already too late.

31
00:02:09.794 --> 00:02:15.295
A bolt of lightning struck the ship, and a strong gust of wind blew out all the lights.

32
00:02:16.576 --> 00:02:18.796
Suddenly everything was pitch-black.

33
00:02:20.197 --> 00:02:23.878
Then another lightning bolt struck and set the ship on fire.

34
00:02:25.218 --> 00:02:28.299
Burning pieces of the ship were scattered everywhere.

35
00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:34.822
By the blazing light, the Little Mermaid could see that the humans were fighting for their lives.

36
00:02:36.143 --> 00:02:39.285
"Oh no," she cried, "the poor humans!"

37
00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:42.647
Some of them were thrown into the sea.

38
00:02:44.127 --> 00:02:45.969
Others jumped from the flaming decks.

39
00:02:45.989 --> 00:02:49.611
"Help! Help!"

40
00:02:50.331 --> 00:02:52.352
they screamed as they fell into the water.

41
00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:58.836
The Little Mermaid saw the woman who wore the blue feather holding onto a table leg.

42
00:03:00.144 --> 00:03:02.166
A man was trying to swim to shore.

43
00:03:02.186 --> 00:03:04.487
"Save me!"

44
00:03:05.128 --> 00:03:06.008
cried one guest.

45
00:03:06.028 --> 00:03:08.870
"I don't want to die!"

46
00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.151
cried another.

47
00:03:11.812 --> 00:03:14.754
All struggled to keep their heads above the waves.

48
00:03:16.255 --> 00:03:19.097
The Little Mermaid searched desperately for the Prince.

49
00:03:20.358 --> 00:03:21.539
Finally she saw him.

50
00:03:22.179 --> 00:03:25.081
He was trying to keep afloat, but he was tired.

51
00:03:26.422 --> 00:03:29.344
He began to slip below the surface of the water.

52
00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.701
"He's going to visit the Sea Kingdom!"

53
00:03:33.262 --> 00:03:34.702
said the Little Mermaid happily.

54
00:03:36.103 --> 00:03:39.585
But then she remembered that humans could not live beneath the sea.

55
00:03:41.066 --> 00:03:44.148
Unlike the sea folk, they could not breathe in the water.

56
00:03:44.168 --> 00:03:46.770
"My Prince will die!

57
00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:49.591
Oh, I must save him!"

58
00:03:50.132 --> 00:03:50.732
she cried.

59
00:03:52.193 --> 00:03:57.056
The Little Mermaid dived through the waves and swam closer to the destroyed ship.

60
00:03:58.416 --> 00:04:01.638
She made her way through the burning wood falling from the ship.

61
00:04:02.959 --> 00:04:07.883
At last she reached the Prince, just as he dropped beneath the raging sea.

62
00:04:09.424 --> 00:04:12.005
He looked like a leaf falling from a tree.

63
00:04:13.326 --> 00:04:17.449
The Little Mermaid grabbed him and pulled his head above the water.

64
00:04:17.469 --> 00:04:20.011
"Hang on, dear Prince.

65
00:04:20.591 --> 00:04:21.332
I've got you!"

66
00:04:21.812 --> 00:04:23.013
she whispered in his ear.

67
00:04:24.394 --> 00:04:27.576
Then she let the waves take them away from the fire.
